          "Title": "1.01.010 - In-house code.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               That in preparation of codifying the existing city code, the city clerk and city attorney\n               have prepared an in-house general revision to the current code of ordinances for the\n               city of Cheyenne, Wyoming to assist in providing a modern and systematic re-organization\n               of material.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. 3514 § 1, 2003)\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
