          "Id": "TIT1GEPR_CH1.01COAD_1.01.020COAD",
          "Title": "1.01.020 - Code adopted.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               That based upon the in-house revision, the code of ordinances of the city of Cheyenne,\n               Wyoming, as professionally compiled, edited, recodified and published by Book Publishing\n               Company, Seattle, Washington, now known as LexisNexis Municipal Codes, of Charlottesville,\n               Virginia, is adopted pursuant to authority granted cities and towns set forth in Wyoming\n               Statute § 15-1-103 (a) (xxxviii).\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. 3514 § 2, 2003)\n               </p></div>",
